---
description: Python conventions for this repo
globs: ["**/*.py"]
alwaysApply: false
---

- Python 3.12, type hints on public functions, `from __future__ import annotations`
  where it helps.
- Pydantic for anything crossing a boundary. `api/schemas.py` types are
  separate from `core/models.py` domain types — never return a domain object
  from a route.
- psycopg 3 with `dict_row`. Parameterised queries only; no f-string SQL.
- Comments explain WHY, especially non-obvious tradeoffs. Do not narrate what
  the code already says.
- No new dependency without saying what it replaces and why the stdlib will
  not do.
